WHAT THIS REPOSITORY CONTAINS
    Build recipes (shell scripts, CMake files, patches) written for this
    project. These are licensed under Apache-2.0; see LICENSE.

WHAT THE RELEASE ARTIFACTS CONTAIN
    Only binaries compiled from third-party source in this project's build:

      * Android platform tools and build tools, compiled from AOSP source at
        tag platform-tools-35.0.2 (Apache-2.0)
      * clang / lld / llvm-* and a bundled CPython, compiled from the
        LLVM Project branch llvm-r522817 and AOSP external/python/cpython3
        (Apache-2.0 with LLVM Exceptions; PSF License for CPython)
      * hermesc, compiled from facebook/hermes (MIT)

    The release artifacts deliberately do NOT contain files redistributed
    from Google's Android SDK or NDK downloads. Those are fetched from
    Google by tools/install.sh at install time, under Google's own terms.

